sition:relative;flex:none}.mark::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:.45rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--card)}h1{font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:600;margin:0;letter-spacing:.01em}h2{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 .75rem}.sub{color:var(--fg);font-size:.95rem}.muted{color:var(--muted)}section{margin:0 0 2rem}.slots{display:grid;gap:.6rem}.slot{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:.75rem;padding:.8rem 1rem}.slot.current{border-color:var(--accent)}.slot-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap}.label{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.95rem;color:var(--fg)}.version{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.9rem;margin:.3rem 0 .15rem}.what{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}.tag{font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;border-radius:999px;padding:.1rem .55rem;border:1px solid}.tag.ok{color:var(--ok);border-color:var(--ok)}.tag.warn{color:var(--warn);border-color:var(--warn)}.tag.fail{color:var(--fail);border-color:var(--fail)}.last{border-left:3px solid;border-radius:.25rem;padding:.5rem .8rem;margin:0 0 1.5rem;background:var(--card)}.last.ok{border-color:var(--ok)}.last.fail{border-color:var(--fail)}.last .muted{display:block;font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}.upload{display:flex;gap:.6rem;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:stretch}.file{flex:1 1 14rem;display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:2.8rem;background:var(--secondary);border:1px dashed var(--border);border-radius:.6rem;padding:0 1rem;cursor:pointer;color:var(--muted)}.file:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}.file input{position:absolute;opacity:0;width:0;height:0}.file:has(input:valid){color:var(--fg);border-style:solid}.file:has(input:valid) .file-label::after{content:" вЂ” ready";color:var(--accent)}code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.9em}button{font:inherit;font-weight:600;border-radius:.6rem;padding:.65rem 1.25rem;border:1px solid transparent;cursor:pointer;min-height:2.8rem}button.primary{background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-fg)}button.primary:hover{filter:brightness(1.08)}button.secondary{background:var(--secondary);color:var(--fg);border-color:var(--border)}button.secondary:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}.row{margin:0 0 .5rem}.note{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin:.75rem 0 0}.release{font-size:1.05rem;margin:0 0 .75rem}footer{color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:1rem}footer a{color:var(--muted)}footer a:hover{color:var(--accent)}a.back{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}a.back:hover{text-decoration:underline}@media (prefers-color-scheme:light){:root{--bg:#f5f9fb;--fg:#0b1a24;--card:#ffffff;--secondary:#e9f0f4;--muted:#4b575f;--border:#c9d6de;--accent:#007daa;--accent-fg:#f5f9fb}}␀№Њ;BЪ␀␀~<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">А<title>А В· evo-esp32</title><style>АD</style></head><body><main><header><div class="mark"></div><div><h1>И␀K</h1><div class="sub muted">evo-esp32</div></div></header><div class="last И␀"><span class="muted">А</span> А	</div><p>А</p>АK<p><a class="back" href="/">Back to the player</a></p></main></body></html>␀refused␀␀␀&8B@␀␀␀ј␀␀␀␀␀␀multipart/form-dataa form with no boundaryboundary=next bootrunning, not nextrunningvalidpending<span class="tag warn">on trial</span><span class="tag ok">confirmed</span>The previous firmware, keptFree for the next updateWhat is playing nowThe copy the player falls back to<p class="note">The firmware that is running is the factory copy, or has not confirmed itself yet. Once an update has run and proved itself, it can be kept here.</p><form method="post" action="/factory" class="row"><button class="secondary" type="submit">Keep this firmware as the factory copy</button></form><p class="note">The factory copy is what the player returns to when both update slots fail. Keeping a firmware there takes a few seconds and does not restart the player.</p><form method="post" action="/boot-factory" class="row"><button class="secondary" type="submit">Restart into the factory copy</button></form><p class="note">For a firmware that runs but is not what you want. The update slots keep their firmware; the next update goes on as before. On the player itself: hold a finger on the panel for five seconds from the moment it lights after power-on.</p>failedЂ…␀<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>А В· evo-esp32</title><style>АD</style></head><body><main><header><div class="mark"></div><div><h1>И␀␀ </h1><div class="sub">evo-esp32 И␀ <span class="muted">А</span></div></div></header>А<<section><h2>Firmware on this player</h2><div class="slots">А</div></section>АЂ‚<section><h2>Update</h2><form method="post" action="/update" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="upload"><label class="file"><input type="file" name="firmware" accept=".bin" required><span class="file-label">Choose the <code>вЂ¦ota.bin</code> file</span></label><button class="primary" type="submit">Update</button></form><p class="note">Playback stops, the file is written to the free slot, and the player restarts into it вЂ” about a minute in all. The new firmware runs on trial first: if it does not start healthily, the player returns to this one by itself. Keep the player powered meanwhile.</p></section><section><h2>Factory copy</h2>ААa</section><footer>evo-esp32 В· <a href="/status">status as text</a></footer></main></body></html>␀empty, running, next boot„6B␀␀␀␀␀␀ЖDBаCB8VBa Display implementation returned an error unexpectedly␀48B„␀␀␀µ␀␀␀␀␀companion_platform_esp_idf::net␀(8Bg␀␀␀␀␀9␀␀␀;:8B…␀␀␀q␀␀␀␀␀esp_idf_svc::eventloopWaiting done - successTimeout while waitingAbout to wait␀␀0